{"name": "SHRIMP GAME: OVERKRILL", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/f1899e38c415f5edd063c92dc392da14.avif?t=1787863671\" width=\"880\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras_big/8a1c765a26ce2bd36703678e03579acf.webp?t=1787863671\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824880/extras/8a1c765a26ce2bd36703678e03579acf.avif?t=1787863671\" width=\"1560\"/></span><strong> </strong><br/><br/><strong>SHRIMP GAME: KRILL CONFIRMED</strong> is an atmospheric third-person looter shooter RPG set in a decaying underwater world replete with horrific sea creatures and <strong>Lovecraftian Bosses</strong>. <br/>Pilot your Submersible Hydrodynamic Research Integrated Marine Platform (SHRIMP), master the\u00a0<strong>six elemental classes</strong> with <strong>powerful fusion abilities</strong>, and unlock specialized <strong>SHRIMP Platforms </strong>each with their own unique strengths and personalities.   <br/>Explore the sunken ruins solo or in <strong>6-player co-op,</strong> or <strong><i>KRILL</i></strong> your friends in <strong>chaotic PvP</strong> modes like Shrimp Royale, Shrimp Tag, and Boss Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>\"Okay... This is ****** awesome...\"</strong></i><strong> - Iron Pineapple</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>\"I think this actually... This is really good.\"</strong></i><strong> - Vinny Vinesauce</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"